# Chibi Companion reads no secrets in Phase 1 (there is no AI provider yet).
#
# Optional overrides:
# Store data somewhere other than %APPDATA%\ChibiCompanion (portable mode, tests).
# CHIBI_DATA_DIR=D:\ChibiData
#
# Phase 2 (AI providers) will NOT read API keys from this file by default:
# keys will be kept in the Windows Credential Manager (keyring). If you opt in
# to environment variables, they will be:
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OLLAMA_HOST=http://localhost:11434
